y"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Digital Gender Rights"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Online abuse"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Cyber harassment"},{"text":"AI-related harms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Policy Advocacy"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legislative reform"},{"text":"Government policy"},{"text":"Gender impact"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. International Gender Rights"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International human rights"},{"text":"Development programmes"},{"text":"Gender policy"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"0–2 Years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal Research Assistant"},{"text":"Advocacy Assistant"},{"text":"Programme Assistant"},{"text":"Human Rights Associate"},{"text":"Legal Aid Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 Years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gender Rights Advocate"},{"text":"Legal Advocacy Associate"},{"text":"Gender Programme Officer"},{"text":"Policy Associate"},{"text":"Human Rights Officer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 Years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Gender Rights Advocate"},{"text":"Gender Justice Specialist"},{"text":"Advocacy Manager"},{"text":"Gender Policy Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"8+ Years"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advocacy Director"},{"text":"Gender Justice Programme Director"},{"text":"Policy Director"},{"text":"Human Rights Leadership"},{"text":"Social Justice Organization Leader"}]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI & Gender Bias"},{"type":"p","text":"AI systems can reproduce or amplify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gender stereotypes"},{"text":"Discriminatory decisions"},{"text":"Unequal treatment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Gender Rights Advocate should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Algorithmic bias"},{"text":"Fairness"},{"text":"Transparency"},{"text":"Accountability"},{"text":"Human oversight"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Technology creates new challenges involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Deepfakes"},{"text":"Non-consensual synthetic media"},{"text":"Online harassment"},{"text":"Automated abuse"},{"text":"Privacy violations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data-Driven Advocacy"},{"type":"p","text":"Organizations increasingly use data to identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inequality"},{"text":"Service gaps"},{"text":"Violence patterns"},{"text":"Representation gaps"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understand gender and equality law"},{"text":"Analyze human-rights issues"},{"text":"Understand family-law frameworks"},{"text":"Research gender jurisprudence"},{"text":"Draft policy briefs"},{"text":"Prepare advocacy reports"},{"text":"Document rights issues ethically"},{"text":"Conduct stakeholder research"},{"text":"Understand workplace gender rights"},{"text":"Understand digital gender harms"},{"text":"Analyze gender-policy data"},{"text":"Use Excel and basic analytics"},{"text":"Conduct legal-awareness programmes"},{"text":"Work with NGOs and public-policy organizations"},{"text":"Apply confidentiality and safeguarding principles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Gender Rights Research Paper"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Gender Policy Brief"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Case-Law Database"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Workplace Equality Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Digital Gender Rights Study"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Community Legal Awareness Project"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Advocacy Report"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"2–3 Relevant Internships"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"GENDER JUSTICE"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"HUMAN RIGHTS LAW"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"CONSTITUTIONAL LAW"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"FAMILY LAW"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"CRIMINAL LAW"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"LEGAL RESEARCH"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"POLICY ANALYSIS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"ADVOCACY"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"GENDER DATA ANALYSIS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"DIGITAL RIGHTS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"SAFEGUARDING & ETHICS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"AI & ALGORITHMIC BIAS AWARENESS"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"PROFESSIONAL COMMUNICATION"}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning for this career is:"},{"type":"p","text":"“Gender justice professional combining legal expertise, human-rights advocacy, policy research, community engagement and evidence-based gender-policy analysis.”"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should develop the ability to connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Rights Issue","Legal Framework","Evidence","Community Impact","Advocacy","Policy Reform","Implementation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Career-Fitment Mapping Note"},{"type":"p","text":"Gender Rights Advocate is a broad career family rather than a single regulated job title. A law graduate can pursue litigation, legal aid, NGO advocacy, policy research, human-rights programmes or institutional gender-equity work. If the student intends to practice law before courts, applicable professional enrolment and practice requirements must be satisfied. For advocacy roles outside court practice, research, policy, communication, safeguarding and field experience can be equally important."}]}]}